odel_lean_source"],"evidence_ids":["support_source_bindings_20261024","support_graph_semantic_review_pending"],"id":"support.diffusion","kind":"claim","label":"Existence, coupling and uniqueness of the controlled diffusion","locator":"regularity.tex:189–238; Diffusion/Uniqueness.lean:13–63","source_id":"support_tex_regularity","statement":"For every gamma in U in the stated zero-field normalization and a fixed standard Brownian system, dX_t=gamma(t)Phi_x(t,X_t)dt+dB_t, X_0=0, has a unique strong solution through time 1. Solutions for L1 coefficient and smooth-terminal approximants driven by the same Brownian motion converge uniformly on compact strips below 1. Every associated diffusion in the selected formal model agrees almost surely with the constructed diffusion for every time in [0,1].","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.diffusion","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/full_support","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22full_support%22%2C%22support.diffusion%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22full_support%22%2C%22support.diffusion%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.diffusion"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/scalar.minimizer_coefficient_budget","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22scalar.minimizer_coefficient_budget%22%2C%22support.diffusion%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f